me: |md
  **Tier 3 · `metaengine` — ONE package holding 9 separable concerns**
  **166 files · 27,701 production LOC · 829 exported symbols = 13% of all tracked API**

  - **store + collections + folds — 48 files**
    `store*.go` · `collection.go` · `fold*.go` · `infer_*.go` · `temporal.go`
  - **engine contract + registry + health — 28 files**
    `engine.go` · `registry.go` · `cap.go` · `probe.go` · `rule_*.go`
  - **planner + cost + layout — 16 files**
    `planner.go` · `cost.go` · `layout*.go` · `priority.go` · `relayout.go`
  - **execution + transactions + SSE — 16 files**
    `execute.go` · `dispatch.go` · `runtime_backend.go` · `sse*.go`
  - **diagnostics + typed readers — 13 files**
    `explain*.go` · `doctor*.go` · `dx.go` · `typed_reader*.go`
  - **ADTs: vector / graph / spatial / as-of — 13 files**
    `vector_*.go` · `graph_*.go` · `spatial.go` · `temporal*.go`
  - **SQL scan + dialect helpers — 11 files**
    `scan*.go` · `cursor.go` · `sanitize.go` · `sql_keyset.go`
  - **in-core memory engine — 8 files**
    `memory_*.go` — the only engine that is NOT its own module
  - **types · errors · capability adapters — 13 files**
    `types.go` · `errors*.go` · `dedup_store.go` · `dueclaim.go` · `persistence.go`
