engines: |md
  **Tier 5 · Engine drivers — 11 modules, each dependency-isolated**

  - memory (in core) · `sqliteengine` (Ca 7) · `tursoengine` · `pebbleengine` · `bboltengine`
  - `badgerengine` · `pgengine` · `mysqlengine` · `duckdbengine` (CGo)
  - `dgraphengine` · `bigtableengine` · `irohengine`
  - every module has its own `init()` → `metaengine.RegisterDriver` (`database/sql` pattern)
| {shape: text}

