v5: |md
  **v5 fork — `core/v5`, 9 of 32 packages (ADR-0152)**

  - mirrored by hand: record · id · dedup · kv · dispatcher · metadata · event · command · query
  - still missing: decider · middleware · system · metaengine · storage · projectionhost + 17 more
  - `cmd/cqrs-upgrade` has no `core/v5` awareness yet, so no fleet repo can migrate
